{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["<b>And afterward</b> Two instances of דין, and the third is ואחר כן תבא אליה ובעלתה. Just as here, on account of clearing out fine vessels so they not become impure, so there too she must remove fine vessels from herself so that she become loathsome in his eyes and he not become impure through her."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:19:25.577119022Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}